# Packets no transmitter may send. A decode that fails says why and where:
# `error <kind> at <offset>`, the offset counting from the start code.

# Nothing at all: not even a start code.
=> error empty at 0
# 513 data slots, one more than a packet may carry; the error points at
# the first slot too many.
